        <mxCell id="sSteps" parent="sae" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" value="&lt;b&gt;Install&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Bring up an HSM on the site network and initialize it for this node.&lt;br&gt;2. Create the node&#39;s identity on the HSM, and the trust anchors. Import this site&#39;s KME client key.&lt;br&gt;3. Install the SAE directory. Every site holds the same copy, and each node is pinned in it. The file stays mode 0644 or stricter.&lt;br&gt;4. Open the firewall as drawn. Other SAEs may reach this registry port and that port plus 40000. Every node adds 40000; the offset is fixed in the software.&lt;br&gt;This node may reach its KME. The HSM stays on the site network.&lt;br&gt;5. Create this site&#39;s database. The node creates the file mode 0600, owner read and write only.&lt;br&gt;6. Start the node. The operator works at its console.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The second SAE repeats these steps." vertex="1">
